{"pageid": 904, "title": "Violet Mask", "revid": 2169, "categories": ["Lore", "Masks", "Monster hunters", "Order of St. George", "Violet Masks"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/be/Violet_Mask.png/revision/latest?cb=20241226194304\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The Violet Mask of \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/be/Violet_Mask.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241226194304\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"98\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Violet Mask.png\" data-image-key=\"Violet_Mask.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Violet_Mask.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The Violet Mask of <span class=\"new\" title=\"The Great House of St. George (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX0dyZWF0X0hvdXNlX29mX1N0Ll9HZW9yZ2U/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">the Great House of St. George.</span></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p><b>Violet Masks</b> are a branch of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a> who don the color purple. They only exist within <span class=\"new\" title=\"The Great House of St. George (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX0dyZWF0X0hvdXNlX29mX1N0Ll9HZW9yZ2U/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">The Great House of St. George</span>, where they exclusively serve <span class=\"new\" title=\"The Dragon King (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX0RyYWdvbl9LaW5nP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">the Dragon King</span> and work as his messengers. The route to become a Violet Mask is unknown, but it is known that they are not to be messed with.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border-style:none; background-color:transparent;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"20\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#7B68EE;font-size:40px;font-family:serif;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;padding:10px 10px;\">“\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:4px 10px;\"><i>The Dragon King does not leave the Great House of St. George, and instead sends his emissaries to enforce his rule among the Congregation of Houses. His emissaries are masked in violet, and are sent to oversee the transition between Dragons, resolve territorial disputes between Houses, and to revoke House charters. The requirements to become a Violet Mask are shrouded in secrecy, and it is said that they know the answers to some of the most fundamental truths that underlie our organization's great work. In any case, it is known that they are all extremely dangerous.</i>\n</td>\n<td width=\"20\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"color:#7B68EE;font-size:40px;font-family:serif;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;padding:10px 10px;\">”\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\"><div style=\"line-height:1em;text-align: right\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">&#8212; <i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Slaughter_1\" title=\"Book of Slaughter 1\">The Book of Slaughter</a></i></cite></div><i></i>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Little is known about the mysterious Violet Masks. They only exist within <span class=\"new\" title=\"The Great House of St. George (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX0dyZWF0X0hvdXNlX29mX1N0Ll9HZW9yZ2U/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">The Great House of St. George</span> in Northern Africa, where they work as messengers and diplomats on behalf of <span class=\"new\" title=\"The Great Dragon (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX0dyZWF0X0RyYWdvbj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">The Great Dragon</span>. They are known to relay his orders, oversee disputes between Houses, and, on occasion, order the destruction of a House. They are also said to know many of the Order's secrets. It is unknown how one becomes a Violet Mask.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOS&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOS-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Violet_Masks\">Known Violet Masks</span></h2>\n<p>The only known house to host Violet Masks is the Great House of St. George. <a href=\"/wiki/Victor_Saint-Georges\" title=\"Victor Saint-Georges\">Victor Saint-Georges</a> is currently the only named Violet Mask, though he may have recruited <a href=\"/wiki/Sara\" title=\"Sara\">a young girl named Sara</a>; it is unknown if she survived or if this would put her on the Violet Mask path.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC0&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC0-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"66e2e22a773c14d566f25d46ff882993\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Violet_Mask-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:100px; width:185px; top:42.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Violet_Mask.png\" title=\"Violet Mask.png (633 KB)\" style=\"height:100px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.